The '''Port District''',<ref name="Coruscant English">{{EncyclopediaCite|Coruscant}} {{C|English version only}}</ref> also known as the '''Port Quarter''', was a district on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]] that contained the planet's two main [[spaceport]] zones. People with no connections were aware of the [[western spaceport]], while visitors used the [[Coruscant Eastern Spaceport|Eastport]]. There were terminals for freight and travel, as well as many buildings that were intended to manage the entrance and exit of individuals, [[starship]]s, and merchandise.<ref name="Coruscant" />

There were several customs offices that controlled the flow of goods and people. Transport companies, such as [[Corellian Merchants' Guild]], [[Romodi Interstellar Company]], [[Galaxy Tours]], and [[Astrotours Limited]], were always hailed by laborers seeking to work on a cargo ship.<ref name="Coruscant" />

